WEBVTT

00:39.914 --> 00:41.041
That person…

00:42.542 --> 00:43.752
I killed her.

00:49.090 --> 00:51.509
Everyone was made
to participate in the game.

00:53.053 --> 00:54.220
It's no one's fault.

00:58.099 --> 00:59.517
Just what in the world is this?

01:02.896 --> 01:05.106
Who knows? I don't know either.

01:05.607 --> 01:06.483
But…

01:08.526 --> 01:11.196
It amazes me
that I'm willing to do anything

01:12.322 --> 01:13.615
just so that I can survive.

01:18.161 --> 01:19.996
If we weren't willing,
we might as well die.

03:42.472 --> 03:44.265
My visa ends today.

03:53.733 --> 03:56.861
Do you even know how hard I worked
to get into this company?

03:59.405 --> 04:01.366
I even had to have sex
with someone like that.

04:04.035 --> 04:05.912
I finally got promoted too.

04:09.165 --> 04:09.999
Saori,

04:10.083 --> 04:11.834
I talked to the HR department already.

04:12.585 --> 04:13.419
Cypher Bank Holdings…

04:13.503 --> 04:14.671
PERSONNEL CHANGE NOTIFICATION

04:14.754 --> 04:18.258
…strongly recommends Saori Shibuki

04:18.341 --> 04:20.426
as the leader
of the next generation AI development.

04:21.344 --> 04:24.472
SPECIAL PROMOTION FOR ASSISTANT
IN THE DEVELOPMENT TEAM

04:26.432 --> 04:27.934
I will survive

04:28.893 --> 04:30.520
and return to my original life.

04:32.939 --> 04:35.275
Arisu! Karube!

04:35.775 --> 04:36.901
I'm so glad!

04:38.278 --> 04:41.990
I was so worried because you guys
didn't come back this morning..

04:42.448 --> 04:43.533
I'm so glad!

04:43.616 --> 04:44.826
Hey.

04:44.909 --> 04:47.036
- Chota!
- That hurts!

04:48.371 --> 04:49.205
You're hurt?

04:50.164 --> 04:50.999
I'm fine.

04:54.252 --> 04:55.670
Someone radioed in?

04:56.170 --> 04:57.171
Yes.

05:01.884 --> 05:02.802
Thanks.

05:06.139 --> 05:07.724
If we go to that place called the Beach,

05:08.641 --> 05:10.226
we might be able to discover something.

05:10.893 --> 05:13.229
Like where all the people
who disappeared went?

05:13.938 --> 05:15.523
Could there be an evacuation shelter?

05:16.774 --> 05:18.234
Maybe everyone else is there.

05:18.985 --> 05:22.905
Are the closest beaches to us
in Shonan, Izu, and Ito?

05:24.449 --> 05:25.450
They're so far.

05:25.992 --> 05:28.786
We can get there.
It's just a matter of time.

05:31.205 --> 05:32.206
What should we do?

05:32.915 --> 05:33.958
Shall we try going there?

05:35.251 --> 05:36.169
In any case,

05:37.545 --> 05:39.714
we have no choice
but to trust that voice for now.

05:41.049 --> 05:43.051
Chota won't be able to make it
with his leg injury.

05:45.803 --> 05:46.763
You're right.

05:49.182 --> 05:50.141
Both of us…

05:52.185 --> 05:53.603
Our visas will expire today.

05:58.107 --> 06:02.278
We'll clear today's game
and increase your visa days.

06:02.362 --> 06:03.529
And then,

06:04.530 --> 06:06.699
let's search for the Beach tomorrow.

06:23.925 --> 06:25.385
I will go to the Beach.

06:27.178 --> 06:28.429
No matter what.

06:30.973 --> 06:32.308
I will do anything it takes.

06:36.437 --> 06:38.314
We still have hope.

06:55.081 --> 06:57.417
It amazes me
that I'm willing to do anything

06:59.043 --> 07:00.545
just so that I can survive.

07:04.966 --> 07:06.968
If we weren't willing,
we might as well die.

07:23.025 --> 07:23.860
Arisu?

07:30.741 --> 07:31.617
What's the matter?

07:38.082 --> 07:38.916
It's nothing.

07:51.679 --> 07:53.055
Say something.

07:55.850 --> 07:56.976
Like what?

07:57.852 --> 08:00.271
Let's see, like gossip?

08:05.776 --> 08:07.695
I saw someone die in front of me.

08:10.656 --> 08:12.116
But I survived.

08:15.119 --> 08:16.245
How should I say this?

08:18.289 --> 08:19.123
You were glad.

08:22.919 --> 08:24.086
Were you relieved?

08:28.049 --> 08:29.842
I didn't think about that, but…

08:34.764 --> 08:35.765
Even so…

08:38.518 --> 08:40.436
I guess I do want to survive.

08:47.068 --> 08:49.195
I told you that last time, right?

08:52.448 --> 08:53.699
During my first game,

08:54.534 --> 08:56.077
everyone except for me died.

09:00.706 --> 09:02.291
I don't want to die like that.

09:05.127 --> 09:06.212
I knew…

09:07.922 --> 09:09.715
I wanted to survive.

09:33.573 --> 09:34.949
Found it!

09:53.384 --> 09:54.719
Please stay safe.

10:13.112 --> 10:16.032
THIS WAY TO THE GAME ARENA

10:23.331 --> 10:24.540
He's late.

10:25.666 --> 10:27.168
Hey, should we just go?

10:28.210 --> 10:29.879
No, we'll wait for Karube.

10:30.588 --> 10:32.715
If we don't join the game,
both of us will die.

10:37.219 --> 10:38.262
Let's go, Chota.

10:40.181 --> 10:42.391
Both of you still have days left
on your visas.

10:53.986 --> 10:54.987
Karube!

10:57.073 --> 10:58.074
Sorry.

10:58.157 --> 11:00.576
- I went to pick up something.
- What do you mean, "sorry"?

11:05.581 --> 11:07.041
Shibuki and I…

11:07.708 --> 11:09.168
This is the end for us.

11:12.213 --> 11:13.047
What's going on?

11:14.674 --> 11:15.800
Don't be so angry.

11:21.389 --> 11:23.140
There's no time. Let's go.

11:28.020 --> 11:29.021
Thank you.

12:32.501 --> 12:33.502
Shall we?

12:48.142 --> 12:52.062
SHINJUKU NATURAL BOTANICAL GARDEN

13:26.305 --> 13:28.724
FEEL FREE TO USE ANY OF THESE

13:29.308 --> 13:30.935
Are we going to dismantle something?

13:38.692 --> 13:39.527
I'll have this.

13:41.070 --> 13:43.030
That looks really impressive.

14:01.090 --> 14:03.092
FACIAL RECOGNITION IN PROGRESS
PLEASE WAIT A MOMENT

14:07.638 --> 14:09.932
Entry registered.

14:11.308 --> 14:14.812
WELCOME! SPONSORED
BY SHINJUKU NATURAL BOTANICAL GARDEN

14:14.895 --> 14:18.816
Please wear the goggles
and proceed into the botanical garden.

14:25.656 --> 14:28.576
THIS WAY

14:53.559 --> 14:56.395
REGISTRATION IN PROGRESS
CURRENT PARTICIPANTS

15:01.567 --> 15:02.776
What is this?

15:06.280 --> 15:08.240
It recognized Chota.

15:08.324 --> 15:10.117
The target cursor turned red
when our eyes met.

15:10.200 --> 15:11.327
It's eye-tracking.

15:13.245 --> 15:14.914
What are they making us do this time?

15:15.706 --> 15:17.666
Registration has closed.

15:18.167 --> 15:19.752
The game will now commence.

15:19.835 --> 15:21.170
THERE ARE CURRENTLY 4 PARTICIPANTS

15:21.253 --> 15:23.047
Difficulty, Seven of Hearts.

15:23.631 --> 15:24.965
Hearts.

15:25.549 --> 15:26.842
Hearts? Isn't it…

15:28.886 --> 15:32.097
The suit on a playing card
usually signifies the game genre.

15:32.181 --> 15:35.100
Club refers to a team battle,
and Diamond refers to a battle of wits.

15:35.184 --> 15:36.769
As for Heart…

15:37.353 --> 15:39.688
It's a game of betrayal
where you play with people's hearts.

15:41.273 --> 15:43.275
Seven. Isn't this quite difficult then?

15:43.859 --> 15:45.152
This is terrible.

15:45.736 --> 15:46.820
What should we do?

15:48.697 --> 15:50.699
Game, "Hide-and-seek."

15:51.659 --> 15:56.163
Rule. One person will be the wolf,
and the other three will be the lambs.

15:56.246 --> 15:59.541
The one found by the wolf
will become the next wolf.

16:00.250 --> 16:04.046
Hide well
so that the wolf does not discover you.

16:04.880 --> 16:09.718
Clear condition. Whoever is
the wolf at the end of the game wins.

16:10.427 --> 16:12.721
Time limit, 15 minutes.

16:13.472 --> 16:14.390
After 15 minutes,

16:14.473 --> 16:17.810
the collars
around all the lambs will explode.

16:17.893 --> 16:19.019
What?

16:19.687 --> 16:20.688
What is going on?

16:21.480 --> 16:23.107
What does this mean?

16:25.275 --> 16:26.652
How is this possible?

16:27.653 --> 16:28.529
What?

16:29.780 --> 16:31.991
This means only one person will survive.

16:33.492 --> 16:34.368
What?

16:35.494 --> 16:36.996
We'll play hide-and-seek,

16:38.497 --> 16:40.958
and the person who is the wolf
at the end of the game wins.

16:41.834 --> 16:43.377
The other three will die.

16:44.920 --> 16:46.130
It's a simple game, huh?

16:48.882 --> 16:51.635
The first wolf is

16:51.719 --> 16:56.473
ID number 1000247.

16:57.891 --> 16:59.059
Chota Segawa.

17:06.233 --> 17:07.234
Me?

17:07.735 --> 17:08.902
Game start.

17:11.071 --> 17:13.574
Fifteen minutes remaining.

17:24.376 --> 17:27.171
Stop it, Chota! If you try to
force it open, the collar might explode!

17:27.254 --> 17:30.632
- Stop it!
- Then what should I do?

17:37.473 --> 17:38.348
Arisu?

17:47.775 --> 17:49.902
When two people lock eyes,
the wolf's role is passed on.

17:51.028 --> 17:52.613
There's a flaw with the game.

17:54.031 --> 17:55.574
If the wolf survives,

17:56.158 --> 17:57.951
there's no point to the lambs hiding!

17:59.119 --> 18:00.370
What should we do, Arisu?

18:03.582 --> 18:04.500
Everyone!

18:11.381 --> 18:12.800
Shibuki?

18:12.883 --> 18:15.385
The one that needs to hide is the wolf!

18:15.469 --> 18:18.305
- Are we going to die?
- We will if this continues.

18:18.388 --> 18:19.556
But it'll be fine.

18:20.224 --> 18:21.183
Shibuki!

18:21.266 --> 18:22.101
- Karube!
- Karube!

18:22.810 --> 18:23.977
Hey!

18:31.026 --> 18:31.860
Wait up!

18:35.030 --> 18:36.115
Hey!

18:39.868 --> 18:41.078
Shibuki!

18:53.048 --> 18:55.968
TROPICAL RAINFOREST

19:23.579 --> 19:24.580
Come out!

19:27.082 --> 19:28.333
Shibuki!

19:57.029 --> 19:59.573
You can hear me, right, Shibuki?

20:00.490 --> 20:01.950
Shibuki!

20:02.701 --> 20:03.785
Don't run away.

20:04.453 --> 20:06.622
Let's think of a way together.

20:07.581 --> 20:08.415
I'm sorry.

20:09.416 --> 20:10.250
I'm sorry.

20:16.048 --> 20:18.800
What's the point in apologizing now? Hey!

20:20.260 --> 20:21.929
- Look at me!
- Get off!

20:23.347 --> 20:24.723
Stop it, Karube!

20:25.307 --> 20:26.516
Hey!

20:28.977 --> 20:30.145
Look over here!

20:36.318 --> 20:37.486
Damn it…

21:03.428 --> 21:07.140
Look over here, damn it!

21:07.224 --> 21:08.183
Hey!

21:10.811 --> 21:11.728
You fucking bitch!

21:17.025 --> 21:18.110
Karube!

21:24.116 --> 21:24.992
Arisu!

21:26.159 --> 21:27.619
Both of you, stop that already!

21:27.703 --> 21:31.164
Please! If we work together as usual,
we might be able to figure things out!

21:31.248 --> 21:33.959
You're too naive.
This is a game of Hearts.

21:44.177 --> 21:46.263
What is happening to all of you?

21:50.142 --> 21:52.227
- You guys are acting weird!
- Damn you, Arisu!

21:53.645 --> 21:55.314
Aren't we on the same side?

21:58.400 --> 22:01.320
Time remaining, ten minutes.

22:03.280 --> 22:04.197
Hey!

22:04.948 --> 22:05.949
Arisu!

22:06.033 --> 22:07.784
O Holy Mother…

22:08.869 --> 22:11.330
- Please save us from our tainted souls.
- Where are you?

22:11.413 --> 22:12.247
Arisu!

22:13.498 --> 22:15.876
Our smiles are the light of hope.

22:17.002 --> 22:19.921
The Holy Mother will appear when we smile.

22:21.798 --> 22:22.799
O Holy Mother…

22:23.967 --> 22:27.554
- Please save us from our tainted souls.
- Hey!

22:27.637 --> 22:28.472
Hey!

22:28.972 --> 22:31.600
Our smiles are the light of hope.

22:32.768 --> 22:35.937
The Holy Mother will appear when we smile.

22:36.772 --> 22:37.606
Damn it!

22:38.690 --> 22:40.150
O Holy Mother,

22:41.360 --> 22:44.488
please save us from our tainted souls.

22:46.073 --> 22:48.492
Our smiles are the light of hope.

22:49.618 --> 22:52.120
The Holy Mother will appear when we smile.

22:59.836 --> 23:01.421
So that's how bad you want to survive.

23:02.422 --> 23:03.840
Just give me a bit of time!

23:03.924 --> 23:06.259
I will think of a solution to this game!

23:07.302 --> 23:08.720
You'll think of a solution?

23:11.723 --> 23:13.975
You just want
to be the only survivor, right?

23:16.144 --> 23:18.230
It doesn't matter if you're dead!

23:20.273 --> 23:21.358
Let me be the wolf.

23:22.150 --> 23:24.027
You've been living
a half-assed life anyway!

23:25.821 --> 23:27.739
There's no point if someone

23:28.240 --> 23:29.991
who has the will to live on dies!

23:32.077 --> 23:33.078
Arisu.

23:34.996 --> 23:37.416
There is no hope left after all!

23:48.510 --> 23:49.678
Chota!

23:49.761 --> 23:52.431
- Let me go!
- Go! Quick!

23:54.307 --> 23:55.684
Let me go!

23:57.144 --> 23:58.353
Wait!

24:00.480 --> 24:02.065
Don't go, Karube!

24:04.401 --> 24:05.318
Let me go!

24:06.153 --> 24:08.113
I let you fuck me!

24:09.281 --> 24:11.324
Do you know who's on your side?

24:12.367 --> 24:13.702
Let me go!

24:15.203 --> 24:16.496
Let go!

24:17.122 --> 24:18.748
- O Holy Mother…
- Let me go!

24:22.836 --> 24:25.005
Eight minutes remaining.

24:33.597 --> 24:35.098
- Let go!
- I can't!

24:38.185 --> 24:39.686
Arisu!

24:44.608 --> 24:46.401
Where are you, Arisu? Come out!

24:48.570 --> 24:49.946
Damn it.

24:50.530 --> 24:52.782
Are you planning
to just hide the entire time?

24:53.408 --> 24:54.534
Damn it!

24:55.035 --> 24:56.328
You lied to us.

25:02.918 --> 25:05.545
And you said
it'll work out if we cooperate?

25:08.048 --> 25:11.176
You just wanted to be the only survivor
in the first place!

25:16.056 --> 25:17.140
Damn it!

25:19.267 --> 25:20.101
Damn it!

26:01.560 --> 26:03.770
I don't know what to do anymore.

26:04.396 --> 26:06.648
Let go of me!

26:06.731 --> 26:07.649
I'm sorry.

26:08.900 --> 26:09.985
I'm sorry!

26:12.612 --> 26:14.698
What's the point in apologizing now?

26:14.781 --> 26:16.116
Arisu!

26:19.703 --> 26:20.870
In the end,

26:21.413 --> 26:22.414
that's all you can say?

26:27.794 --> 26:29.713
Ever since you dropped out of university…

26:30.213 --> 26:31.214
Hey.

26:33.300 --> 26:35.302
All you've ever done is say sorry!

26:35.885 --> 26:37.887
- Hey!
- I'm sorry.

26:38.597 --> 26:39.598
I'm sorry!

26:40.890 --> 26:41.725
I'm sorry.

26:50.358 --> 26:52.360
Congratulations
on your acceptance, Hajime.

26:52.444 --> 26:54.487
You really did your best.

26:54.988 --> 26:56.531
Your mother would be so happy.

26:57.032 --> 26:59.659
But this is just the beginning.

27:01.202 --> 27:03.288
Even if I go to university,
I might end up like Ryohei.

27:04.331 --> 27:08.084
Your brother doesn't devote himself
to anything. But you do.

27:08.168 --> 27:09.753
You have something to work hard on.

27:10.879 --> 27:13.131
You are different from Ryohei.

27:16.009 --> 27:18.511
Ryohei, why don't you come over
and have some, too?

27:31.483 --> 27:34.027
If you're just going to be
a loser forever,

27:35.362 --> 27:38.239
then let me be the wolf!

27:43.036 --> 27:44.621
Arisu!

27:53.380 --> 27:55.882
Five minutes remaining.

27:58.593 --> 28:00.011
Enough already.

28:01.888 --> 28:06.434
I don't care who survives in the end.

28:11.481 --> 28:12.482
But…

28:14.401 --> 28:17.612
I don't want it to end this way!

28:40.051 --> 28:42.512
Is this about Arisu and Chota again?

28:49.394 --> 28:52.021
You're really kind.

29:38.193 --> 29:40.487
I don't really expect anything from you.

29:43.198 --> 29:44.199
Hajime…

30:32.664 --> 30:34.082
This is awesome.

30:35.083 --> 30:36.292
It's really good!

31:10.952 --> 31:12.120
Arisu.

31:14.831 --> 31:17.584
I have a dream.

31:19.711 --> 31:22.881
I want to buy a huge farm in Australia.

31:24.841 --> 31:27.844
I'll invite you guys over,
and we'll drink beer all day!

31:29.387 --> 31:30.305
That sounds nice!

31:30.388 --> 31:34.934
Then I'll deliver the highest-quality
beef steak to you through drone delivery!

31:35.685 --> 31:38.897
The drone will be fully automated.
I'll make an app for it!

31:38.980 --> 31:39.898
All right then.

31:40.398 --> 31:41.983
- Cheers to our future!
- Cheers!

31:42.066 --> 31:45.445
You better keep your promise,
you hear that?

32:38.623 --> 32:41.084
Time remaining, three minutes.

32:53.388 --> 32:56.015
I'll drop out.

32:59.185 --> 33:02.689
I'll drop out of this game.

33:06.818 --> 33:07.819
You guys…

33:09.404 --> 33:11.239
are all I have.

33:14.117 --> 33:16.452
If someone has to survive this game,

33:18.705 --> 33:19.706
it's not me.

33:24.127 --> 33:25.169
I'll leave the game.

33:28.464 --> 33:32.010
Karube, Chota. Where are you guys?

33:35.847 --> 33:37.056
Karube, Chota.

33:44.897 --> 33:45.898
Karube!

33:46.941 --> 33:47.775
Chota!

33:49.068 --> 33:49.902
Hey!

33:55.783 --> 33:56.617
Chota!

33:59.162 --> 33:59.996
Chota?

34:01.497 --> 34:02.415
Where are you?

34:03.124 --> 34:04.167
Chota!

34:11.758 --> 34:13.051
Chota!

34:16.763 --> 34:17.847
Chota?

34:19.807 --> 34:20.850
Where are you?

34:20.933 --> 34:22.351
Chota!

34:23.603 --> 34:26.522
YOU BECOME THE WOLF IF YOU ARE FOUND
HIDE WELL SO THE WOLF WON'T FIND YOU

34:27.106 --> 34:28.191
Karube!

34:29.525 --> 34:30.568
Chota!

34:31.277 --> 34:32.528
Where are you guys?

34:33.446 --> 34:34.822
Please come out!

34:36.449 --> 34:37.283
Hey!

34:38.159 --> 34:41.079
HIDE SO THAT THE WOLF WON'T FIND YOU

34:46.667 --> 34:49.420
Karube! Where are you?

34:51.631 --> 34:53.466
Why are you guys keeping silent now?

34:56.511 --> 34:57.720
Karube!

35:02.183 --> 35:06.104
HIDE WELL, SHEEP

35:06.896 --> 35:08.064
Where are you guys?

35:10.024 --> 35:11.025
Karube!

35:13.945 --> 35:15.071
Chota!

35:18.282 --> 35:19.158
Chota!

35:21.577 --> 35:22.578
Karube!

35:23.121 --> 35:25.039
Come out, please!

35:26.707 --> 35:27.875
Shut up!

35:30.253 --> 35:31.129
Karube!

35:40.429 --> 35:41.973
Making a ruckus like idiots

35:43.474 --> 35:44.976
and drinking the whole night away.

35:47.728 --> 35:49.313
When I'm with you guys,

35:50.148 --> 35:52.066
I forget about all the troubles I have.

35:54.026 --> 35:59.073
You remember, right? That hot summer day
we made noodles with shaved ice.

35:59.866 --> 36:02.368
Karube, where are you?

36:04.745 --> 36:05.663
Karube!

36:09.834 --> 36:12.295
We laughed a lot then, didn't we?

36:15.590 --> 36:16.507
Chota?

36:17.008 --> 36:20.136
Chota laughed so hard
that noodles came out from his nose.

36:22.096 --> 36:24.473
You don't have to mention that.

36:25.474 --> 36:28.394
Where are you guys? Chota, Karube!

36:30.229 --> 36:31.272
Arisu.

36:33.441 --> 36:34.525
Live on for us.

36:45.536 --> 36:46.996
Karube!

36:47.580 --> 36:48.623
Chota!

36:49.123 --> 36:51.751
Thirty seconds remaining.

37:03.012 --> 37:03.846
It's not me.

37:04.764 --> 37:06.432
I shouldn't be the one to stay alive!

37:07.934 --> 37:09.060
Twenty seconds.

37:09.143 --> 37:10.144
I'm behind you.

37:14.941 --> 37:16.025
I'm sorry.

37:16.943 --> 37:19.278
I'm sorry, Shibuki.

37:19.362 --> 37:21.614
- Ten seconds.
- Arisu.

